OL,3,GNEWSACrime commissioners oppose 'mega
OL,4,Aforce' merger
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuffolk's police and crime commissioner
OL,7,F(PCC) has reaffirmed his opposition to
OL,8,Fany "mega force" or large regional
OL,9,Fforce to replace the county's
OL,10,Fconstabulary.
OL,12,FTim Passmore said the idea of Suffolk
OL,13,Fmerging with forces in Bedfordshire,
OL,14,FCambridgeshire, Essex, Hertfordshire
OL,15,Fand Norfolk would not be in the
OL,16,Finterests of the largely rural county.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
